  "period_note": "HALF-YEARLY filing (occupies the Q2 slot per project convention). Balance sheet is the 30-Jun-2021 period-end snapshot (reported), Solo basis. Income statement items are CUMULATIVE from 1 January 2021 (H1=6 months). This filing's page layout places three statements (Balance Sheet / P&L / Cash Flow) side-by-side, which badly corrupts a fresh OCR pass on some rows (notably the off-balance-sheet total); the RAW pdftotext extraction was used instead where it is cleaner (confirmed via a 'Statement of Changes in Equity' exhibit that independently reproduces the same period-end equity components), and it reconciles perfectly. Comparative (31-Dec-2020) column matches this dataset's existing 2020_Q4.json exactly for total_assets (303,516.861297m), total_liabilities (286,570.133912m), total_equity (16,946.727385m), paid_up_capital (8,853.46404m), statutory_reserve (6,430.798085m), total_deposits (229,484.573179m) and off_balance_sheet_exposures (63,852.699814m). Balance-sheet identity holds exactly (290,080.426135 + 18,229.955794 = 308,310.381929). statutory_reserve corroborated by the 20%-of-PBT rule (6,430.798085m + 20% x 1,906.270005m = 6,812.052086m, exact) and by a second independent source (the equity roll-forward exhibit's own closing balance). Income statement fully reconciles: NII+investment+commission+other = total_operating_income (2,660.844907+1,025.668604+742.451796+291.669555=4,720.634862 exact); operating_profit = total_operating_income - total_operating_expenses (4,720.634862-2,523.911786=2,196.723076 exact); profit_before_tax = operating_profit - total_provision (2,196.723076-290.453071=1,906.270005 exact); profit_after_tax = profit_before_tax - tax_expense (1,906.270005-622.927442=1,283.342563 exact). These H1-2021 figures (NII 2,660.844907m, investment income 1,025.668604m, PBT 1,906.270005m) are independently cross-confirmed by appearing identically as the prior-year comparative column in the later onebankplc-half-yearly-2022.txt filing.",
